### Enterprise Multi-Agent & Orchestration API
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Discover Registered Agent Cards & Squad Roles
# @name getAgentCards
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/cards
Accept: application/json

### 2. Execute Single Specialized Agent
# @name runSingleAgent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/run
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "Review governing law and liability caps under the Master Services Agreement.",
  "track_code": "F"
}

### 3. Run Benchmark Race: Agent Loop vs Fixed Workflow
# @name runAgentRace
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/race
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "Verify termination for convenience notice requirements.",
  "track_code": "F"
}

### 4. Execute Multi-Agent Squad (Manager + Specialists)
# @name runMultiAgentSquad
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/multi-agent/squad-run
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "Cross-check GDPR Data Processing Addendum against standard clauses.",
  "track_code": "F"
}

### 5. Simulate Agent-to-Agent (A2A) Task Lifecycle (Success Scenario)
# @name simulateA2ATaskSuccess
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/a2a/task/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "action": "create",
  "task_id": "task-compliance-001",
  "track_code": "F",
  "simulate_failure": false
}

### 6. Simulate Agent-to-Agent (A2A) Task Lifecycle (Failure & Retry Scenario)
# @name simulateA2ATaskFailure
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/a2a/task/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "action": "create",
  "task_id": "task-compliance-err-002",
  "track_code": "F",
  "simulate_failure": true
}
